  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 220°C. Line a large baking tray with baking paper if you have it.",
    "Put the aubergine, courgette, red pepper, red onion, cherry tomatoes and chickpeas on the tray.",
    "Add the garlic, olive oil, cumin, paprika, ground coriander, salt and black pepper. Toss well so everything is evenly coated.",
    "Spread the mixture out in a single layer and roast for 25 minutes, stirring halfway through, until the vegetables are tender and starting to brown at the edges.",
    "Scatter the feta over the tray and roast for 5 to 7 minutes more, until the feta is warmed through and lightly golden.",
    "Finish with parsley and a good squeeze of lemon. Serve hot, as is or with flatbread if desired."
